<div class="idcult-faq-section">
  <div class="idcult-faq-container" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage">

    <div class="idcult-faq-item">
      <button class="idcult-faq-question">
        <span>Where does iDCult deliver?</span>
        <span class="idcult-faq-icon"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="idcult-faq-answer">
        <div class="idcult-faq-answer-inner">
          <p>We currently deliver within India. International shipping is not available.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="idcult-faq-item">
      <button class="idcult-faq-question">
        <span>How much does shipping cost?</span>
        <span class="idcult-faq-icon"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="idcult-faq-answer">
        <div class="idcult-faq-answer-inner">
          <p>Prepaid orders are shipped free. A flat ₹100 COD fee applies to COD orders unless a specific offer says otherwise.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="idcult-faq-item">
      <button class="idcult-faq-question">
        <span>How long does delivery take?</span>
        <span class="idcult-faq-icon"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="idcult-faq-answer">
        <div class="idcult-faq-answer-inner">
          <p>Orders are generally dispatched within 48 hours. Most orders arrive within 5–7 business days from dispatch; remote areas and peak periods may take longer.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="idcult-faq-item">
      <button class="idcult-faq-question">
        <span>How can I track my order?</span>
        <span class="idcult-faq-icon"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="idcult-faq-answer">
        <div class="idcult-faq-answer-inner">
          <p>Tracking details are shared after dispatch through the contact information provided at checkout.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="idcult-faq-item">
      <button class="idcult-faq-question">
        <span>Can I cancel my order?</span>
        <span class="idcult-faq-icon"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="idcult-faq-answer">
        <div class="idcult-faq-answer-inner">
          <p>Request cancellation as soon as possible. It depends on processing status; once dispatched, an order normally cannot be cancelled through Customer Care.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="idcult-faq-item">
      <button class="idcult-faq-question">
        <span>Can iDCult cancel my order?</span>
        <span class="idcult-faq-icon"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="idcult-faq-answer">
        <div class="idcult-faq-answer-inner">
          <p>Yes, for reasons such as stock unavailability, pricing/listing errors, suspected fraud, technical issues or serviceability limitations. Eligible prepaid amounts are refunded.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="idcult-faq-item">
      <button class="idcult-faq-question">
        <span>What is the return period?</span>
        <span class="idcult-faq-icon"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="idcult-faq-answer">
        <div class="idcult-faq-answer-inner">
          <p>Eligible products can be returned within 7 days from delivery, subject to the Return Policy.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="idcult-faq-item">
      <button class="idcult-faq-question">
        <span>What condition must a returned product be in?</span>
        <span class="idcult-faq-icon"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="idcult-faq-answer">
        <div class="idcult-faq-answer-inner">
          <p>Unused and unworn, with original tags, packaging and accessories intact, and subject to a quality/condition check.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="idcult-faq-item">
      <button class="idcult-faq-question">
        <span>Can I exchange for another size?</span>
        <span class="idcult-faq-icon"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="idcult-faq-answer">
        <div class="idcult-faq-answer-inner">
          <p>Yes, eligible products can generally be exchanged within 7 days of delivery, subject to stock availability and the exchange conditions.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="idcult-faq-item">
      <button class="idcult-faq-question">
        <span>Can I exchange for a different style?</span>
        <span class="idcult-faq-icon"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="idcult-faq-answer">
        <div class="idcult-faq-answer-inner">
          <p>Not automatically. Where offered, Customer Care will advise the process; otherwise you may need to return the eligible item and place a new order.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="idcult-faq-item">
      <button class="idcult-faq-question">
        <span>Are Clearance Sale products returnable/exchangeable?</span>
        <span class="idcult-faq-icon"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="idcult-faq-answer">
        <div class="idcult-faq-answer-inner">
          <p>Clearance Sale products are not eligible for a cash refund or a standard return without exchange. However, size exchange or product exchange is permitted within 7 days of delivery, subject to availability, quality/condition requirements, payment of any applicable product price difference, and payment by the customer of all courier costs for sending the original product to our warehouse and re-shipping the replacement product.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="idcult-faq-item">
      <button class="idcult-faq-question">
        <span>What if I receive the wrong product?</span>
        <span class="idcult-faq-icon"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="idcult-faq-answer">
        <div class="idcult-faq-answer-inner">
          <p>Contact <a href="mailto:care@idcult.com">care@idcult.com</a> promptly with your order number and photographs. We will review and arrange the appropriate resolution.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="idcult-faq-item">
      <button class="idcult-faq-question">
        <span>What if my product is damaged on delivery?</span>
        <span class="idcult-faq-icon"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="idcult-faq-answer">
        <div class="idcult-faq-answer-inner">
          <p>Report it to Customer Care as soon as possible, preferably with photographs of the package and product.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="idcult-faq-item">
      <button class="idcult-faq-question">
        <span>What if I find a manufacturing defect?</span>
        <span class="idcult-faq-icon"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="idcult-faq-answer">
        <div class="idcult-faq-answer-inner">
          <p>Contact Customer Care with your order/invoice details and photographs. Claims should be raised within 3 months and are subject to assessment.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="idcult-faq-item">
      <button class="idcult-faq-question">
        <span>What does the claim policy cover?</span>
        <span class="idcult-faq-icon"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="idcult-faq-answer">
        <div class="idcult-faq-answer-inner">
          <p>Genuine manufacturing defects. Normal wear, accidental damage, rough use, burns, cuts, punctures, animal damage and other external damage are generally not covered.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="idcult-faq-item">
      <button class="idcult-faq-question">
        <span>How will I receive my refund?</span>
        <span class="idcult-faq-icon"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="idcult-faq-answer">
        <div class="idcult-faq-answer-inner">
          <p>Approved prepaid returns are generally refunded to the original payment method. The applicable refund method for COD orders will be communicated during the return process.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="idcult-faq-item">
      <button class="idcult-faq-question">
        <span>How long does a refund take?</span>
        <span class="idcult-faq-icon"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="idcult-faq-answer">
        <div class="idcult-faq-answer-inner">
          <p>Processing begins after the returned product is received and approved. Bank/payment-provider timelines then apply.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="idcult-faq-item">
      <button class="idcult-faq-question">
        <span>Is the COD fee refundable?</span>
        <span class="idcult-faq-icon"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="idcult-faq-answer">
        <div class="idcult-faq-answer-inner">
          <p>Generally no, subject to applicable law and the circumstances of the order.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="idcult-faq-item">
      <button class="idcult-faq-question">
        <span>What payment methods are available?</span>
        <span class="idcult-faq-icon"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="idcult-faq-answer">
        <div class="idcult-faq-answer-inner">
          <p>The methods available to you are displayed at checkout and may vary by order/location.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="idcult-faq-item">
      <button class="idcult-faq-question">
        <span>Can I combine discount codes?</span>
        <span class="idcult-faq-icon"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="idcult-faq-answer">
        <div class="idcult-faq-answer-inner">
          <p>Unless an offer expressly permits stacking, promotional codes generally cannot be combined.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="idcult-faq-item">
      <button class="idcult-faq-question">
        <span>Why was my apparently available product order cancelled?</span>
        <span class="idcult-faq-icon"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="idcult-faq-answer">
        <div class="idcult-faq-answer-inner">
          <p>Inventory can change quickly. If stock is exhausted or a listing/technical error is identified, the order may be cancelled and eligible prepaid amounts refunded.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="idcult-faq-item">
      <button class="idcult-faq-question">
        <span>How do I contact iDCult?</span>
        <span class="idcult-faq-icon"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="idcult-faq-answer">
        <div class="idcult-faq-answer-inner">
          <p>Email <a href="mailto:care@idcult.com">care@idcult.com</a> or call +91 9910433300, Monday to Saturday, 09:30 AM–06:00 PM.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="idcult-faq-item">
      <button class="idcult-faq-question">
        <span>How do I choose the right size?</span>
        <span class="idcult-faq-icon"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="idcult-faq-answer">
        <div class="idcult-faq-answer-inner">
          <p>Use the size guide on the product page and compare it with your foot measurement. Contact Customer Care if you need help.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="idcult-faq-item">
      <button class="idcult-faq-question">
        <span>Can colours look different from the website?</span>
        <span class="idcult-faq-icon"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="idcult-faq-answer">
        <div class="idcult-faq-answer-inner">
          <p>Yes. Screen settings, lighting and photography can cause minor differences.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="idcult-faq-item">
      <button class="idcult-faq-question">
        <span>Can I return without raising a return request first?</span>
        <span class="idcult-faq-icon"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="idcult-faq-answer">
        <div class="idcult-faq-answer-inner">
          <p>No. Please contact Customer Care or use the website return facility before sending anything back.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="idcult-faq-item">
      <button class="idcult-faq-question">
        <span>What if my return fails the quality check?</span>
        <span class="idcult-faq-icon"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="idcult-faq-answer">
        <div class="idcult-faq-answer-inner">
          <p>If it is used, damaged, missing tags/packaging or otherwise ineligible, the return may be rejected and the product may be sent back.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="idcult-faq-item">
      <button class="idcult-faq-question">
        <span>Do you accept international orders?</span>
        <span class="idcult-faq-icon"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="idcult-faq-answer">
        <div class="idcult-faq-answer-inner">
          <p>No. iDCult currently ships within India only.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="idcult-faq-item">
      <button class="idcult-faq-question">
        <span>How do I report a website/payment problem?</span>
        <span class="idcult-faq-icon"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="idcult-faq-answer">
        <div class="idcult-faq-answer-inner">
          <p>Email <a href="mailto:care@idcult.com">care@idcult.com</a> with your order number and a description/screenshot. Never send your full card number, CVV, password or OTP.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .idcult-faq-section {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 20px 40px;
  }

  .idcult-faq-container {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .idcult-faq-item {
    background: #d1d1d1;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .idcult-faq-question {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 90px;
    border: 0;
    background: transparent;
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 25px 56px;

    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;

    color: #172534;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .idcult-faq-icon {
    width: 17px;
    height: 17px;
    border-right: 2px solid #172534;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #172534;
    transform: rotate(45deg);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-left: 25px;
    margin-top: -8px;
  }

  .idcult-faq-item.active .idcult-faq-icon {
    transform: rotate(225deg);
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .idcult-faq-answer {
    max-height: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: max-height 0.4s ease;
  }

  .idcult-faq-answer-inner {
    padding: 0 56px 35px;
  }

  .idcult-faq-answer p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #172534;
  }

  .idcult-faq-answer a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {
    .idcult-faq-section {
      padding: 10px 15px;
    }

    .idcult-faq-item {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .idcult-faq-question {
      min-height: 70px;
      padding: 18px 20px;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .idcult-faq-answer-inner {
      padding: 0 20px 25px;
    }

    .idcult-faq-answer p {
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .idcult-faq-icon {
      width: 13px;
      height: 13px;
      margin-left: 15px;
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {

    const faqItems = document.querySelectorAll('.idcult-faq-item');

    faqItems.forEach(function(item) {

      const button = item.querySelector('.idcult-faq-question');
      const answer = item.querySelector('.idcult-faq-answer');

      button.addEventListener('click', function() {

        const isOpen = item.classList.contains('active');

        faqItems.forEach(function(otherItem) {
          otherItem.classList.remove('active');
          otherItem.querySelector('.idcult-faq-answer').style.maxHeight = null;
        });

        if (!isOpen) {
          item.classList.add('active');
          answer.style.maxHeight = answer.scrollHeight + 'px';
        }

      });

    });

  });
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "iDCult FAQ Page",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}